  "details": "<p><span>The town is mentioned in an inscription of Ninurta-kudurri-u\u1e63ur of Suhu. According to that text, it is near a river, on a bank opposite of K\u0101r-Apladad (Gleieh).</span></p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An unlocated town in the kingdom of Suhu that is reported to have been near the Euphrates River, on the bank opposite K\u0101r-Apladad (Gleieh). ",
